# Raw HTML escape hatch (v9.3.0)
#
# When EPL's built-in element vocabulary does not cover what you need
# (e.g. <table>, <video>, <details>), use the `Raw HTML "..."` keyword
# to emit a string of HTML verbatim. The author takes responsibility
# for safety — never pass user input here unsanitised.

Page "Raw HTML Demo"
    Heading "Tables, video, and details (none of which EPL has keywords for)".

    Raw HTML "<table border='1'><tr><th>Lang</th><th>Year</th></tr><tr><td>EPL</td><td>2024</td></tr></table>".

    Raw HTML "<video controls width='320'><source src='/demo.mp4' type='video/mp4'></video>".

    Raw HTML "<details><summary>Click to expand</summary><p>Hidden content here.</p></details>".

    Text "Built-in EPL elements still work alongside Raw HTML blocks.".
End
